eement is intersection size/10. Short, full-length, truncated, and batched coverage are all required before sensitivity. External-label mutation remains explicitly untested; no hidden labels are accessed.", "Movies_and_TV:history_sensitivity": "Training-prefix diagnostic, not host validation. Uniformly select up to 64 users before inspecting outcomes, one endpoint/user uniformly among endpoints with >=4 preceding interactions and a target absent from the complete prefix. Negatives are 99 unique real items absent from that complete prefix and distinct from target; later events never determine eligibility. Seed 42. Complete-prefix exclusions and candidates remain fixed across all variants. Serving truncates to maxlen-1 and appends MASK at index maxlen-1. Delete earliest/latest k=min(2,floor((visible_count-1)/2)) visible items into attention-masked PAD holes; preserve surviving absolute positions and MASK index, without backfill. Swap final two visible items. Repeated historical IDs are permitted. Unknown IDs are excluded and counted, not negative labels.", "Movies_and_TV:paired_statistics": "Variant minus original: target_score_delta in logits; target_rank_delta in one-based positions (positive means deterioration); reciprocal_rank_delta uses 1/rank; diagnostic_hit10_delta uses indicator(rank<=10). top10_overlap is intersection/10; ordered_ranking_agreement compares complete ordered candidate rankings. Equal-user category means and 500 CPU paired-user bootstrap replicates, seed 42, percentile 95% intervals. Intervals cover sampled-user uncertainty only. Raw paired outcomes are retained for a four-category aggregation; that macro is unavailable in a single-category ModelView, never computed over fewer categories.", "Movies_and_TV:elapsed_diagnostic_seconds": "Wall seconds including warmup, loading, probes, and CPU bootstrap, CUDA synchronized at both boundaries; all diagnostic GPU work consumes search budget.", "Movies_and_TV:availability": "Null means unavailable; cou