y; fixed 100 candidates, absolute positions, padding mask, and appended MASK. Two frequency/recency-matched non-PAD replacement rules at the most recent history position: uniform donor, then closest-frequency distinct donor. Exploration selects one site and sign per rule and direction; confirmation uses disjoint users. Delta means intervention minus its unpatched destination baseline. Primary fixed_contrast holds the strongest clean negative identity constant; switching_margin permits competitor changes. tenth_negative_margin measures the diagnostic HR@10 boundary. Rank is one-based; overlap/agreement reference the clean ranking. Identity, final-history structural-zero, and final-MASK restoration checks use atol=1e-5/rtol=1e-4. Missing unrelated donors block confirmation. Random-site controls match layer, recency band, component count, and activation-change norm, verified after floating-point addition. Descriptive magnitude quartiles use exploration only and are frozen for confirmation. Every registered residual hook must execute exactly once per forward. Raw control outcomes are retained. Equal-user means and 500 paired-user bootstrap percentile intervals are descriptive. Confirmatory sign tests exclude and count exact zeros. Global Holm adjustment remains unavailable until all four categories are aggregated; the reported 16*p bound is conservative Bonferroni, not Holm. Partial or timed-out runs never yield confirmatory p-values. No repairs are trained, fused, or compared by this diagnostic."}
